#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:4
msgid "Plans & Pricing"
msgstr "Planes & Pricing"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:9
msgid ""
"Service Plans determine the amount of compute resources available to each "
"Instance. When provisioning new Instances from |morpheus|, a plan is "
"selected which determines the number of CPU cores, amount of memory and the "
"amount of storage available to the associated machines. Additionally, when "
"converting discovered instances in integrated clouds to |morpheus|-managed "
"Instances, the user selects a plan which best fits the instance as it is "
"currently configured. When Instances are reconfigured, a new plan may be "
"selected which redefines the compute resources which should be available to "
"the Instance."
msgstr ""
"Service Planes determine el amount de compute recursos disponible a cada "
"Instancia. Cuando aprovisionamiento nuevo Instancias desde |morpheus|, a "
"plan es seleccionado que determina el número de CPU cores, amount de memory "
"y el amount de storage disponible a el associated machines. Adicionalmente, "
"cuando converting discovered instancias en integrated nubes a "
"|morpheus|-gestionado Instancias, el usuario selects a plan que best fits el"
" instancia as ello es currently configurado. Cuando Instancias son "
"reconfigured, a nuevo plan puede be seleccionado que redefines el compute "
"recursos que debería ser disponible a el Instancia."

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:11
msgid ""
"Plans can be as specific or open-ended as the user would like, restricting "
"the user to the resources defined in the plan or allowing the user to "
"increase those amounts at provision time. Price sets are associated with "
"plans, which is how |morpheus| can compute cost values even for Instances "
"running in private, on-prem Clouds."
msgstr ""
"Planes puede ser as específico o open-ended as el usuario would like, "
"restricting el usuario a el recursos defined en el plan o allowing el "
"usuario a increase esos amounts en provision time. Precio sets son asociado "
"con planes, que es how |morpheus| puede compute cost valores even para "
"Instancias running en private, en-prem Nubes."

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:13
msgid ""
"The Plans & Pricing section is where Plans, Prices Sets and Prices are "
"managed. These concepts are associated with each other in the following way:"
" Prices are added to Prices Sets, and Price Sets are added to Plans. Plans "
"include Service Plans, Load Balancer Price Plans, Virtual Image Prices Plans"
" and Snapshot Price Plans. Price sets can be agnostic and available for any "
"Plan, or specific to a Region Code, Cloud or even a specific Resource Pool. "
"Prices are configured per Price Type and can be added to Price Set "
"configurations that support the Price Type. Master Tenant Prices can apply "
"to all Tenants or be assigned to a single Tenant."
msgstr ""
"El Planes & Pricing sección es donde Planes, Precios Sets y Precios son "
"gestionado. Estos concepts son asociado con cada otro en lo siguiente way: "
"Precios son agregado a Precios Sets, y Precio Sets son agregado a Planes. "
"Planes include Service Planes, Load Balancer Precio Planes, Virtual Image "
"Precios Planes y Snapshot Precio Planes. Precio sets puede ser agnostic y "
"disponible para cualquier Plan, o específico a a Region Code, Nube o even a "
"específico Recurso Pool. Precios son configurado per Precio Tipo y puede ser"
" agregado a Precio Establecido configurations ese soporte el Precio Tipo. "
"Inquilino maestro Precios puede aplicar a todos Inquilinos o be asignado a a"
" single Inquilino."

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:15
#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:25
msgid ""
"A set of Service Plans are seeded by |morpheus| for private cloud provision "
"types as well as some public clouds. Additional Plans and Prices are synced "
"in for other public clouds when the corresponding cloud types are added to "
"an appliance. Users can create new Service Plans or edit the system-seeded "
"Service Plans for Private Cloud types. Service Plans configurations cannot "
"be created or edited for Public Cloud provision types."
msgstr ""
"Un establecido de Service Planes son seeded por |morpheus| para private "
"cloud provision tipos así como algunos público nubes. Additional Planes y "
"Precios son synced en para otro público nubes cuando el corresponding cloud "
"tipos son agregado a un appliance. Usuarios puede crear nuevo Service Planes"
" o editar el system-seeded Service Planes para Private Nube tipos. Service "
"Planes configurations no puede ser creado o edited para Público Nube "
"provision tipos."

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:18
msgid "Plans"
msgstr "Planes"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:20
msgid ""
"Plans types include Service Plans and Price Plans. Service Plans determine "
"the memory, storage and cores configuration during provisioning and "
"reconfigure."
msgstr ""
"Planes tipos include Service Planes y Precio Planes. Service Planes "
"determine el memory, storage y cores configuración durante aprovisionamiento"
" y reconfigure."

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:23
msgid "Service Plans"
msgstr "Service Planes"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:30
msgid "Service Plan Configuration"
msgstr "Service Plan Configuración"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:32
msgid ""
"Not all fields listed below are available for every provision type. After "
"selecting the provision type, the correct fields for that type of Service "
"Plan will be revealed. Not all fields are required to save a valid Service "
"Plan"
msgstr ""
"No todos campos listed below están disponibles para every provision tipo. "
"Después de selecting el provision tipo, el correct campos para ese tipo de "
"Service Plan será revealed. No todos campos son obligatorios a save a valid "
"Service Plan"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:34
msgid "**NAME:** The name of the Service Plan in |morpheus|"
msgstr "**NAME:** El nombre de el Service Plan en |morpheus|"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:35
msgid ""
"**ACTIVE:** Inactive Service Plans are not available for selection during "
"provisioning or reconfigure. New discovered records cannot be associated "
"with deactivated Plans when converting to managed resources. Any resources "
"attached to a Plan will continue to be associated if the Plan is later "
"deactivated"
msgstr ""
"**ACTIVE:** Inactive Service Planes son no disponible para selection durante"
" aprovisionamiento o reconfigure. Nuevo discovered records no puede ser "
"asociado con deactivated Planes cuando converting a gestionado recursos. "
"Cualquier recursos attached a a Plan va a continue a be associated si el "
"Plan es later deactivated"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:36
#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:110
#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:123
#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:134
msgid "**CODE:** A unique identifier for use in |morpheus| API and CLI"
msgstr "**CODE:** Un único identifier para usar en |morpheus| API y CLI"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:37
msgid ""
"**DISPLAY ORDER:** Configures the order in which plans are displayed "
"relative to other plans associated with the same provision type. Note that "
"Plans will be displayed in low-to-high order based on the Display Order "
"property. This is reversed from Layouts which are displayed in high-to-low "
"order"
msgstr ""
"**DISPLAY ORDER:** Configures el order en que planes son mostrado relative a"
" otro planes asociado con el mismo provision tipo. Tenga en cuenta que "
"Planes será mostrado en low-a-high order basado en el Mostrar Order "
"property. Este es reversed desde Layouts que son mostrado en high-a-low "
"order"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:38
msgid ""
"**PROVISION TYPE:** Determines the resource Provision Type this Service Plan"
" is available for when provisioning, reconfiguring and converting discovered"
" resources to managed"
msgstr ""
"**PROVISION TYPE:** Determina el recurso Provision Tipo este Service Plan "
"está disponible para cuando aprovisionamiento, reconfiguring y converting "
"discovered recursos a gestionado"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:39
msgid ""
"**REGION CODE:** (Optional) Limits availability of the Service Plan to "
"Clouds with the specified Region Code"
msgstr ""
"**REGION CODE:** (Optional) Limits availability de el Service Plan a Nubes "
"con el specified Region Code"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:40
msgid "**STORAGE:** The default storage size of the root volume (in MB or GB)"
msgstr ""
"**STORAGE:** El predeterminado storage size de el root volume (en MB o GB)"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:41
msgid ""
"**CUSTOMIZE ROOT VOLUME:** Allows the root volume size to be customized "
"during provisioning or reconfigure. Custom Range limits, if set, will apply"
msgstr ""
"**CUSTOMIZE ROOT VOLUME:** Permite el root volume size a be customized "
"durante aprovisionamiento o reconfigure. Personalizado Range limits, si "
"establecido, va a aplicar"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:42
msgid ""
"**CUSTOMIZE EXTRA VOLUMES:** Allows the extra volume sizes to be customized "
"during provisioning or reconfigure. Custom Range limits, if set, will apply"
msgstr ""
"**CUSTOMIZE EXTRA VOLUMES:** Permite el extra volume sizes a be customized "
"durante aprovisionamiento o reconfigure. Personalizado Range limits, si "
"establecido, va a aplicar"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:43
msgid ""
"**ADD VOLUMES:** Allows additional volumes to be added during provisioning "
"or reconfigure"
msgstr ""
"**ADD VOLUMES:** Permite adicional volumes a be agregado durante "
"aprovisionamiento o reconfigure"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:44
msgid "**MEMORY:** The amount of memory included with the plan (in MB or GB)"
msgstr "**MEMORY:** El amount de memory included con el plan (en MB o GB)"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:45
msgid ""
"**CUSTOM MEMORY:** Allows the amount of memory to be customized during "
"provisioning or reconfigure. Custom Range limits, if set, will apply"
msgstr ""
"**CUSTOM MEMORY:** Permite el amount de memory a be customized durante "
"aprovisionamiento o reconfigure. Personalizado Range limits, si establecido,"
" va a aplicar"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:46
msgid "**CORE COUNT:** The number of virtual CPU cores included with the plan"
msgstr "**CORE COUNT:** El número de virtual CPU cores included con el plan"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:47
msgid ""
"**CUSTOM CORES:** Allows the number of virtual CPU cores to be customized "
"during provisioning or reconfigure. Custom Range limits, if set, will apply"
msgstr ""
"**CUSTOM CORES:** Permite el número de virtual CPU cores a be customized "
"durante aprovisionamiento o reconfigure. Personalizado Range limits, si "
"establecido, va a aplicar"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:48
msgid ""
"**CORES PER SOCKET:** Determines core distribution across sockets. CORES PER"
" SOCKET cannot be larger than CORE COUNT, and CORE COUNT must be divisible "
"by CORES PER SOCKET. For example four CORES with two CORES PER SOCKET means "
"two sockets would have two cores each assigned. Four CORES with one CORE PER"
" SOCKET would have four sockets with one core each assigned, and four CORES "
"with four CORES PER SOCKET would have one socket with four cores assigned"
msgstr ""
"**CORES PER SOCKET:** Determina core distribution a través de sockets. CORES"
" PER SOCKET no puede ser larger than CORE COUNT, y CORE COUNT debe ser "
"divisible por CORES PER SOCKET. Para ejemplo four CORES con two CORES PER "
"SOCKET means two sockets would tienen two cores cada asignado. Four CORES "
"con uno CORE PER SOCKET would tienen four sockets con uno core cada "
"asignado, y four CORES con four CORES PER SOCKET would tienen uno socket con"
" four cores asignado"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:49
msgid ""
"**TOTAL STORAGE:** When custom storage is enabled for the plan, this sets a "
"minimum and maximum total storage allowed (all disks combined)"
msgstr ""
"**TOTAL STORAGE:** Cuando personalizado storage está habilitado para el "
"plan, este sets a minimum y maximum total storage allowed (todos disks "
"combined)"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:50
msgid ""
"**PER DISK SIZE:** When custom storage is enabled for the plan, this sets "
"the minimum and maximum storage for each disk"
msgstr ""
"**PER DISK SIZE:** Cuando personalizado storage está habilitado para el "
"plan, este sets el minimum y maximum storage para cada disk"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:51
msgid ""
"**CUSTOM MEMORY RANGE:** The minimum and maximum allowed amount of memory "
"for the Plan when CUSTOM MEMORY is enabled for the Plan"
msgstr ""
"**CUSTOM MEMORY RANGE:** El minimum y maximum allowed amount de memory para "
"el Plan cuando CUSTOM MEMORY está habilitado para el Plan"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:52
msgid ""
"**CUSTOM CORES RANGE:** The minimum and maximum allowed amount of virtual "
"CPU cores for the Plan when CUSTOM CORES is enabled for the Plan"
msgstr ""
"**CUSTOM CORES RANGE:** El minimum y maximum allowed amount de virtual CPU "
"cores para el Plan cuando CUSTOM CORES está habilitado para el Plan"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:53
msgid ""
"**SOCKETS:** The minimum and maximum allowed sockets range for the Plan when"
" CUSTOM CORES is enabled for the Plan"
msgstr ""
"**SOCKETS:** El minimum y maximum allowed sockets range para el Plan cuando "
"CUSTOM CORES está habilitado para el Plan"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:54
msgid ""
"**CORES PER SOCKET:** The minimum and maximum allowed cores per socket for "
"the Plan when CUSTOM CORES is enabled for the Plan"
msgstr ""
"**CORES PER SOCKET:** El minimum y maximum allowed cores per socket para el "
"Plan cuando CUSTOM CORES está habilitado para el Plan"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:55
msgid ""
"**PRICE SETS:** In the Price Sets tab, associate Price Sets with the Plan. "
"See :ref:`Adding Price Sets to Plans`"
msgstr ""
"**PRICE SETS:** En el Precio Sets pestaña, associate Precio Sets con el "
"Plan. See :ref:`Adding Precio Sets to Plans`"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:57
msgid ""
"Custom Range storage and memory values units (GB/MB) are inherited from the "
":STORAGE:: and :MEMORY:: GB/MB settings in the same Plan. For example, if "
":STORAGE: is configured for for 40 GB, a custom range for Storage would also"
" be in GB."
msgstr ""
"Personalizado Range storage y memory valores units (GB/MB) son heredado "
"desde el :STORAGE:: y :MEMORY:: GB/MB configuración en el mismo Plan. Por "
"ejemplo, si :STORAGE: es configurado para para 40 GB, a personalizado range "
"para Storage would también be en GB."

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:60
msgid "Create Service Plan"
msgstr "Crear Service Plan"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:62
msgid ""
"|morpheus| offers a few distinct types of service plans, each with different"
" data fields to track and valid Price Set types which can be associated. For"
" more on Service Plan configuration, see the preceding section."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| offers a few distinct tipos de service planes, cada con diferente"
" data campos a track y valid Precio Establecido tipos que puede ser "
"associated. Para más en Service Plan configuración, consulte la preceding "
"sección."

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:64
msgid ""
"Price Sets can be added to the Plan at creation time so often it makes sense"
" to create the Prices and associate them with Price Sets before creating the"
" Plan. Additional instructions for creating Prices and Price Sets are in the"
" next section. With the Price Sets ready, continue with the instructions "
"below to create Price Plans of various types."
msgstr ""
"Precio Sets puede ser agregado a el Plan en creation time so often ello "
"makes sense a crear el Precios y associate them con Precio Sets antes de "
"creando el Plan. Additional instructions para creando Precios y Precio Sets "
"son en el next sección. Con el Precio Sets ready, continue con el "
"instructions below a crear Precio Planes de various tipos."

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:66
msgid "Navigate to |AdmPla| (``/admin/service-plans``)"
msgstr "Navegue a |AdmPla| (``/admin/service-plans``)"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:67
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`+ ADD` dropdown and select the appropriate Plan type"
msgstr ""
"Haga clic en el :guilabel:`+ ADD` menú desplegable y seleccione el "
"appropriate Plan tipo"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:68
msgid ""
"Configure details for the Plan on the General tab, the configuration options"
" will depend on the Plan type. See the section above for a detailed "
"description of each configuration option available for Service Plans"
msgstr ""
"Configure detalles para el Plan en el General pestaña, el configuración "
"opciones va a depend en el Plan tipo. Consulte la sección above para a "
"detailed description de cada configuración opción disponible para Service "
"Planes"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:69
msgid ""
"On the Price Sets tab, associate all relevant Price Sets with the Plan. The "
"desired Price Sets must already exist. If needed, you may save the Plan at "
"this point and come back to associate Price Sets later"
msgstr ""
"En el Precio Sets pestaña, associate todos relevant Precio Sets con el Plan."
" El desired Precio Sets debe already existir. Si needed, usted puede save el"
" Plan en este point y come back a associate Precio Sets later"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:70
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:75
msgid "Add Price Set(s) to Plan"
msgstr "Agregar Precio Establecido(s) a Plan"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:77
msgid ""
"Select a Price Unit to list available Price Sets which have the selected "
"Price Unit. Available Price Sets are filtered to show only those which are "
"relevant for the Plan type you've selected"
msgstr ""
"Seleccionar a Precio Unit a lista disponible Precio Sets que tienen el "
"seleccionado Precio Unit. Disponible Precio Sets son filtered a show solo "
"esos que son relevant para el Plan tipo usted've seleccionado"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:78
msgid "Select a Price Set from the list and click :guilabel:`+ ADD`"
msgstr ""
"Seleccionar a Precio Establecido desde el lista y click :guilabel:`+ ADD`"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:79
msgid ""
"Add additional Price Sets if desired (multiple Price Sets can be associated "
"with a Plan)"
msgstr ""
"Agregar adicional Precio Sets si desired (múltiples Precio Sets puede ser "
"asociado con a Plan)"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:80
msgid ""
"Added Price sets can be removed from a Plan by clicking the |trash| icon"
msgstr ""
"Agregado Precio sets puede ser removed desde a Plan por clicking el |trash| "
"icon"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:81
msgid "Once all Price Sets have been added, select :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"
msgstr ""
"Once todos Precio Sets han sido agregado, seleccionar :guilabel:`SAVE "
"CHANGES`"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:83
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`+ADD` button must be clicked after selecting a Price Set or "
"it will not be added to a Plan."
msgstr ""
"El :guilabel:`+ADD` botón debe ser clicked después de selecting a Precio "
"Establecido o ello no be agregado a a Plan."

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:86
msgid "Service Plan Permissions"
msgstr "Service Plan Permisos"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:88
msgid ""
"Group and Tenant Access permissions determine availability of a Service "
"Plan."
msgstr ""
"Grupo y Inquilino Acceso permisos determine availability de a Service Plan."

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:90
msgid ""
"Group Access determines what Groups the Service Plan will be available in "
"for Provisioning and Reconfigure."
msgstr ""
"Grupo Acceso determina what Grupos el Service Plan será disponible en para "
"Aprovisionamiento y Reconfigure."

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:91
msgid ""
"Group Access settings only apply to the Tenant they are configured in, as "
"Groups are not multi-tenant."
msgstr ""
"Grupo Acceso configuración solo aplicar a el Inquilino ellos son configurado"
" en, as Grupos son no multi-inquilino."

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:92
msgid ""
"For multi-tenant environments, the |master tenant| can set Tenant "
"Permissions to determine if the Service Plan is available to all Tenants "
"(public visibility) or assign the Service Plan to one or multiple Tenants."
msgstr ""
"Para multi-inquilino entornos, el |master inquilino| puede establecido "
"Inquilino Permisos a determine si el Service Plan está disponible a todos "
"Inquilinos (público visibilidad) o assign el Service Plan a uno o múltiples "
"Inquilinos."

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:95
msgid "Removing Plans"
msgstr "Removing Planes"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:97
msgid ""
"Plans can be removed by navigating to the Service Plans list page "
"(|AdmPlaPla|), opening the ACTIONS menu for a Plan, and then selecting "
"\"Remove\". Removing a Plan makes it no longer visible, however, it does not"
" hard delete the Plan as the record must remain for any existing "
"associations' usage and price tracking. Synced Plans should be deactivated "
"rather than removed."
msgstr ""
"Planes puede ser removed por navigating a el Service Planes lista página "
"(|AdmPlaPla|), opening el ACTIONS menu para a Plan, y then selecting "
"\"Remove\". Removing a Plan makes ello no longer visible, sin embargo, ello "
"hace no hard delete el Plan as el record debe remain para cualquier "
"existente associations' usage y precio tracking. Synced Planes debería ser "
"deactivated rather than removed."

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:102
msgid "Load Balancer Price Plans"
msgstr "Load Balancer Precio Planes"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:104
msgid ""
"Load Balancer Price Plans configure pricing for Load Balancers and Load "
"Balancer Virtual Servers."
msgstr ""
"Load Balancer Precio Planes configure pricing para Load Balancers y Load "
"Balancer Virtual Servidores."

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:106
msgid "Load Balancer Price Plan Configuration:"
msgstr "Load Balancer Precio Plan Configuración:"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:108
msgid "**NAME:** The name of the Load Balancer Price Plan in |morpheus|"
msgstr "**NAME:** El nombre de el Load Balancer Precio Plan en |morpheus|"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:109
#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:122
#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:133
msgid ""
"**ACTIVE:** When Active, Prices in Price Sets added to the Price Plan will "
"apply to associated resources as configured"
msgstr ""
"**ACTIVE:** Cuando Active, Precios en Precio Sets agregado a el Precio Plan "
"va a aplicar a associated recursos as configurado"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:111
msgid ""
"**LOAD BALANCER TYPE:** Select the load balancer type the Price Plan should "
"be associated with"
msgstr ""
"**LOAD BALANCER TYPE:** Seleccione el load balancer tipo el Precio Plan "
"debería ser asociado con"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:112
msgid ""
"**PRICE SETS:** In the Price Sets tab, associate Price Sets with the Plan. "
"Load Balancer Price Sets may be associated with Load Balancer-type and Load "
"Balancer Virtual Server-type Prices. Fore more, see :ref:`Adding Price Sets "
"to Plans`"
msgstr ""
"**PRICE SETS:** En el Precio Sets pestaña, associate Precio Sets con el "
"Plan. Load Balancer Precio Sets puede be asociado con Load Balancer-tipo y "
"Load Balancer Virtual Servidor-tipo Precios. Fore más, see :ref:`Adding "
"Precio Sets to Plans`"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:115
msgid "Virtual Image Price Plans"
msgstr "Virtual Image Precio Planes"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:117
msgid ""
"Virtual Image Price Plans configure pricing for Virtual Images. Pricing is "
"associated per Price and Price Set configurations, but in general applies to"
" Images with location records in the Price Plans specified Cloud type. "
"Virtual Image Price Plans are for setting pricing for Virtual Image storage,"
" not for adding pricing to resources that use Virtual Images associated with"
" Virtual Image Price Plans. Virtual Image Price Plans do not apply to "
"uploaded Virtual Images that have not been copied to a location in the "
"specified Cloud type yet."
msgstr ""
"Virtual Image Precio Planes configure pricing para Virtual Images. Pricing "
"es associated per Precio y Precio Establecido configurations, pero en "
"general se aplica a Images con location records en el Precio Planes "
"specified Nube tipo. Virtual Image Precio Planes son para setting pricing "
"para Virtual Image storage, no para adding pricing a recursos ese usar "
"Virtual Images asociado con Virtual Image Precio Planes. Virtual Image "
"Precio Planes hacer no aplicar a uploaded Virtual Images ese tienen no been "
"copied a a location en el specified Nube tipo yet."

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:119
msgid "Virtual Image Price Plan Configuration:"
msgstr "Virtual Image Precio Plan Configuración:"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/plans.rst:121
msgid "**NAME:** The name of the Virtual Image Price Plan in |morpheus|"
msgstr "**NAME:** El nombre de el Virtual Image Precio Plan en |morpheus|"

